{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52463","headline":"守岁 · 高宗皇帝李治","name":"守岁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今宵冬律尽，来朝丽景新。\n花余凝地雪，条含煖吹分。\n绶吐芽犹嫩，冰台已镂津。\n薄红梅色冷，浅绿柳轻春。\n送迎交两节，暄寒变一辰。\n（见上海图书馆藏明抄本宋蒲积中《古今岁时杂咏》卷四一）（按：《全唐诗》卷二收本诗有缺文，今重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高宗皇帝李治","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52463.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52463","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}